# Tenured Tethermage with two lands: the trigger offers both and its controller picks the Mountain, so the Forest stays
# on the battlefield (CR 701.21a), the Mountain reaches the graveyard and the two tapped Heartwood tokens are made. Only
# a land may be sacrificed, and only one the controller has: Mox Ruby (a nonland) and Bot2's Island are refused.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mountain
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Tenured Tethermage
Forest
Forest
Forest x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Opt x19

